    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hi, I'm Yumiko! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In charge of admin matters here at Sakugari chess school~ \ud83c\udf38</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm pleased to welcome you!\u00a0It is my ambition to share the beauty of chess with you, teaching and learning together step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ll pair you with the other girls during class to help you master new strategies and level up your game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and we also host fun events outside of class, so there\u2019s always something to look forward to!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I can't wait to meet you in person! Let\u2019s make lots of great memories together!\u00a0\u2764\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet your new classmates at Sakuragi chess school and get to know them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with the girls in mini chess battles (chess knowledge not required)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat  after class, go on dates, explore around the school</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize your fully functional flip phone to your advantage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items and unlock doors to understand more about the secrets of the school</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D\u0334\u0300\u0346\u0302\u034c\u0358\u034b\u0346\u033d\u033e\u030b\u0350\u0311\u0344\u0307\u0356\u035a\u032c\u033a\u0349\u0318\u032b\u034eo\u0334\u034b\u031b\u030a\u0313\u035b\u033d\u0301\u030d\u0307\u0351\u034c\u031b\u030b\u0358\u030b\u0300\u0341\u0320\u034e\u0331\u0319\u033b\u0349\u0348 \u0338\u0315\u030f\u034b\u0357\u032an\u0338\u0360\u034c\u0302\u0343\u0357\u0312\u0350\u0326\u031c\u0324\u032a\u0330\u0321\u0349\u0324\u0359\u0331\u0320\u031e\u032a\u033co\u0337\u0350\u0310\u035b\u0310\u031b\u035d\u0305\u030b\u031a\u0346\u0300\u0306\u0351\u0341\u0346\u034d\u0329\u033a\u0331\u0332\u0324\u0